        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.flyingbark.com.au/coming-soon/doomsweepers\">Doomsweepers</a> is a planned animated series and <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/doomsweepersone/doomsweepers-the-comic-series-issue-one\">comic book</a> about a hazmat'd-up cleaning squad  find themselves at the heart of a biological containment breach. The <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_5ihqjmqEg\">4 minute pitch video</a> for the series doubles as a kinetic and delightful short/music video in its own right.<br/><br/>From showrunner Sarah Harper and studio <a href=\"https://www.flyingbark.com.au/\">Flying Bark</a>, known for their work on Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles, Moon Girl <a href=\"https://www.flyingbark.com.au/released\">and more</a>.",
