        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2027/10/iphone-duo-15.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple marketing SVP Greg Joswiak said today that the number of iPhone Duo-ready apps on the App Store is twice what it was when Apple last reported the figure. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080454\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/iphone-duo-now-has-twice-as-many-optimized-apps-as-it-did-10-days-ago/#more-1080454\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
