        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/13/tvos-27-2-1-launching-soon-with-siri-ai-for-older-apple-tv-4k-models/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/apple-tv-homepod-mini-siri-ai.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today the new Apple TV 4K has arrived (<a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0aaK8plC\">order here</a>) with Siri AI as a major tentpole feature. But older Apple TV 4K models are about to get Siri AI too via a tvOS 27.2.1 software update.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,apple-tv-4k,siri,siri-ai,tvos-27,tvos-27-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1079340\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/13/tvos-27-2-1-launching-soon-with-siri-ai-for-older-apple-tv-4k-models/#more-1079340\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
