        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/when-ai-generated-data-becomes-tomorrows-ground-truth/",
        "content_text": "Manufacturers qualify suppliers before trusting them with critical work. Before a supplier can provide parts for a regulated product such as a medical device, the manufacturer collects evidence: quality certifications, test reports, insurance documents, and regulatory approvals. Increasingly, an AI agent reads that evidence first. The agent reviews the documents and proposes a finding, and [&#8230;]",
