        "content_text": "“Kickers are too good now” sounds plausible when long field goals keep making the highlights. But in the November 9 episode of The Monday Morning Agent, our AI analyst found that long kicks went through at roughly the same rate across the seasons on file. Coaches were attempting them more often. We gave the agent [&#8230;]",
