        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/when-ai-can-code-what-is-left-for-programmers-to-do/",
        "content_text": "AI is in such widespread use for programming that project maintainers (particularly for free and open source software) are complaining about the burden of reviewing mounds of low-quality code. In fact, AI can help with every stage of code development: writing the specification, coding, uncovering bugs, and repairing the code. This article describes human-AI collaboration [&#8230;]",
