        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/this-week-in-ai-who-gets-to-benefit-from-ai/",
        "content_text": "AI is becoming more capable at handling everyday tasks, but benefiting from that progress depends increasingly on where people live, what language they speak, and how much control they have over the technology. On the latest episode of This Week in AI, we examined developments from OpenAI and Anthropic, the growing push for regional AI [&#8230;]",
