        "title": "What Makes an Agent Self-Evolving?",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/what-makes-an-agent-self-evolving/",
        "content_text": "An agent can get better at its job without a new model. It can learn to find useful information, choose the right tool, or check that a task is finished before reporting success. For that experience to help with the next task, something has to carry over: an updated instruction, a lesson saved in memory, [&#8230;]",
