        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/why-ai-agents-are-repeating-2019s-microservices-mistake/",
        "content_text": "Microservices changed how we build software by breaking large applications into smaller, independently deployable services. That made systems easier to develop and scale, but it introduced a different class of problems: The behavior of the whole system got harder to see. AI agents are now following a similar path. A workflow that once lived inside [&#8230;]",
