        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/tom-of-finland-foundation-battle.html\">The dispute between the board and the longtime caretaker</a> has left the foundation on the brink of collapse and the original work of a seminal gay artist hidden from public view in a storage facility in downtown Los Angeles. The board of directors continues to fundraise as it looks for a permanent home for the nonprofit. For Dehner, who is at work on a book about his life with Tom, regaining control of the organization he cofounded is a deeply personal crusade. [Intelligencer; <a href=\"https://periscope.corsfix.com/?https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/tom-of-finland-foundation-battle.html\">ungated</a>]",
