        "title": "HomeView missing some podcast feeds? Here’s why",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/homeview-missing-some-podcast-feeds-heres-why/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/homeview-hand-touch.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s new <a href=\"https://link.amazon/A08BZbV9N\">HomeView</a> features the Podcasts app, but not all feeds appear to be supported for now. Instead, HomeView <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/08/tvos-27-removes-a-feature-that-some-apple-tv-users-might-miss-after-updating/\">appears to have the same bug that tvOS 27 introduced</a> to the Apple TV 4K’s Podcasts app.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,homeview,podcasts,tvos-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080117\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/homeview-missing-some-podcast-feeds-heres-why/#more-1080117\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
