        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-value-of-human-expertise-in-the-software-factory/",
        "content_text": "“Any sufficiently advanced technology is indistinguishable from magic.” – Arthur C. Clarke Most developers now write less code by hand. Gergely Orosz recently posted that modern software engineering is no longer done without LLMs and will no longer be done without them. Some miss writing code, while others question how much of the code that [&#8230;]",
